From: Kernel Hacking <dev@local>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] power: smb-lib: Prevent charging hard stop on thermal peak

Modifikasi smblib_set_prop_system_temp_level() di smb-lib.c:
1. Parallel charging tetap aktif di semua thermal level
2. Pada thermal level tertinggi, gunakan floor 1000mA daripada stop total
3. Charging tidak pernah benar-benar berhenti karena thermal daemon

Sebelum: Level tertinggi = chg_disable (stop charging sepenuhnya)
Sesudah: Level tertinggi = FCC minimum dari tabel (1000mA)
---
 drivers/power/supply/smb-lib.c | 10 +++++-----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/power/supply/smb-lib.c b/drivers/power/supply/smb-lib.c
--- a/drivers/power/supply/smb-lib.c
+++ b/drivers/power/supply/smb-lib.c
@@ -2082,14 +2082,16 @@ int smblib_set_prop_system_temp_level(struct smb_charger *chg,
 	chg->system_temp_level = val->intval;
-	/* disable parallel charge in case of system temp level */
-	vote(chg->pl_disable_votable, THERMAL_DAEMON_VOTER,
-			chg->system_temp_level ? true : false, 0);
+	/* Keep parallel charging active at all thermal levels */
+	vote(chg->pl_disable_votable, THERMAL_DAEMON_VOTER, false, 0);
 
-	if (chg->system_temp_level == chg->thermal_levels)
-		return vote(chg->chg_disable_votable,
-			THERMAL_DAEMON_VOTER, true, 0);
+	/* At peak thermal level: use floor current instead of hard stop */
+	if (chg->system_temp_level == chg->thermal_levels) {
+		vote(chg->chg_disable_votable, THERMAL_DAEMON_VOTER, false, 0);
+		return vote(chg->fcc_votable, THERMAL_DAEMON_VOTER, true,
+			chg->thermal_mitigation[chg->thermal_levels - 1]);
+	}
 
 	vote(chg->chg_disable_votable, THERMAL_DAEMON_VOTER, false, 0);
 	if (chg->system_temp_level == 0)
